00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:05.960
So what's this party trick?

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.319
- Um...

00:00:07.319 --> 00:00:08.910
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.180
- I feel like the all boys school's

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:11.110
about to come out right now.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.320
- A hundred percent.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.050
No, my party trick is that I love making

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:15.900
so I have a scatatonic sense of humor.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:16.890
Does anyone know what that means?

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.360
- A scatatonic?

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:19.193
- [Idris] Sense of humor.

00:00:19.193 --> 00:00:20.026
