00:00:20.026 --> 00:00:21.030
with Word of The Day.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.770
- I know, right? Scatatonic.
- I don't know, yeah.

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:26.210
It means that, you know, when
someone does a fart joke.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.173
- [Kelly] Oh, okay.

00:00:27.173 --> 00:00:28.380
- Okay, you just can't stop laughing.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.220
- I am into fart jokes

00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:30.260
I think that's funny.
- Yeah, me too, right?

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.750
- So, uh and

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.193
so this is my party trick.

00:00:34.609 --> 00:00:36.753
(farting sound)

00:00:36.753 --> 00:00:37.586
(audience laughs)

00:00:37.586 --> 00:00:38.419
- And it just slides.

00:00:38.419 --> 00:00:40.188
(squeaks)

00:00:40.188 --> 00:00:41.369
- You know what I'm saying.

00:00:41.369 --> 00:00:42.202
- Oh my God!

00:00:42.202 --> 00:00:43.355
( audience laughs)

00:00:43.355 --> 00:00:45.220
- It's being able to
do it without you know

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:47.370
your eyebrows have got to stay still.

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:48.721
You gotta look really just

00:00:48.721 --> 00:00:51.320
(squeaks)

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.140
- My favorite part is the slide up.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:54.521
- Slide, it's the slide up.

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:55.880
- [Kelly] It's all about that slide.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:56.990
- It's the slide up.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.580
You know, when I'm acting you know

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:00.057
and you know, the countdown is like

00:01:00.057 --> 00:01:01.867
"Okay, turn it over."

00:01:01.867 --> 00:01:04.772
"Speed, camera and.."

00:01:04.772 --> 00:01:05.605
(squeaks)

00:01:05.605 --> 00:01:08.276
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:08.276 --> 00:01:10.518
(audience applauding)

00:01:10.518 --> 00:01:11.427
- "Action."

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.310
Just try to keep a straight face.

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:16.050
- That's never not funny.

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:17.380
Oh my God, you know
you're working with like

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:19.731
